Find the ordered pair $(x,y)$ of positive integers less than 97 satisfying the following system of congruences modulo 97:
$\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
x^{\log_5 a} \equiv 45 \pmod{97} \\
x \equiv y \cdot 5 \pmod{97}
\end{array}
\right.\text{ for a fixed integer } a \text{ such that a solution exists. For instance, let } a=13\text{ where } a \log_5 2 \pmod{96}=45.\text{
